  "ingredients": [
    "6 cups chicken broth, or as needed",
    "3 tablespoons olive oil, divided",
    "1 pound portobello mushrooms, thinly sliced",
    "1 pound white mushrooms, thinly sliced",
    "2 medium shallots, diced",
    "1.5 cups Arborio rice",
    "0.5 cup dry white wine",
    "0.33333334326744 cup freshly grated Parmesan cheese",
    "4 tablespoons butter",
    "3 tablespoons finely chopped chives",
    "sea salt and freshly ground black pepper to taste"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/EZFUWAhanJYFYx4uPBINsJTxnoU=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/85389-gourmet-mushroom-risotto-step-01-19e89c0432e245eaa1d8da782eec7550.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85389/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Warm broth in a saucepan over low heat. Meanwhile, warm 2 tablespoons olive oil in a deep-sided large saucepan over medium-high heat. Add sliced portobello and white mushrooms; cook and stir until soft, about 3 minutes. Remove mushrooms and their liquid to a bowl; set aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/fF9he-WvcdsQqC17cfwBZ9BteTg=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/85389-gourmet-mushroom-risotto-step-2-60-598ac33c9cf14b178bd10f735b4add6b.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85389/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Add remaining 1 tablespoon olive oil to the saucepan. Stir in shallots and cook for 1 minute. Add rice; cook and stir until rice is coated with oil and pale, golden in color, about 2 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/0mZYoDg1zHQbgrGVURVHNEDKHMc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/85389-gourmet-mushroom-risotto-step-4-66-64df8c340d0b43629d58471ae4172902.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85389/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour in wine, stirring constantly until wine is fully absorbed. Add ½ cup warm broth to the rice, and stir until the broth is absorbed.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/rqhisuuMEB0cMaIom1fjV8zDNuQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/85389-gourmet-mushroom-risotto-step-6-73-5af6a0e1c8cb447d96cc6c8d7081ebf2.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85389/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Continue adding broth, ½ cup at a time, stirring constantly, until the liquid is absorbed and the rice is tender, yet firm to the bite, about 15 to 20 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/IW-Z4-9HcC6xB0cAPe6lC-nB1y4=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/85389-gourmet-mushroom-risotto-step-7-76-24854e9b97f645c7a992bacddbb663e6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85389/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Remove from heat. Stir in reserved mushrooms and their liquid, Parmesan cheese, butter, and chives; season with salt and pepper.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/B8F5_EmIVTy772lewQxZV_E6UgI=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/85389-gourmet-mushroom-risotto-step-9-79-807993d0f99a4460891e974631d59410.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/85389/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Serve immediately.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/854efwMYEwilYjKr0FiF4FkwBvM=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/85389-gourmet-mushroom-risotto-DDMFS-4x3-a8a80a8deb064c6a8f15452b808a0258.jpg"
